# This file transplants to the graphy-os repo root ALONGSIDE its existing rules.
# Keep it to what the engine product needs; the tenant entries live over there.

# ── python build + test artifacts ──
# Without these, every pytest run offers __pycache__ and egg-info up for staging,
# and artifact noise is the cheapest way to make a public history unreadable.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# ── local environments ──
.venv/
venv/

# ── tenants ──
# A tenant's compiled substrate is rebuilt by its rebuild.sh, and its descriptor
# carries absolute paths for this machine. Neither is ever tracked.
tenants/*/substrate/
tenants/*/tenant.json
# A refresh's sibling substrate and descriptor (`graphy refresh`): the newer release, proven
# beside the current one until the operator promotes it. Rebuilt, never tracked.
tenants/*/substrate.*/
tenants/*/tenant.*.json
